	["What 150-225 takes that the Auction House sells and no step above farms: 1 {item:7971}. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold."] = "",

	-- Step 27: Expert Enchanting
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting
	["Expert {skill:333}"] = "高級{skill:333}",
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting · {npc:11072} Kitta Firewind · {zone:1429} Elwynn Forest · {npc:11074} Hgarth · {zone:1442} Stonetalon Mountains · {spell:13628} Runed Golden Rod · {item:5500} Iridescent Pearl · {item:7971} Black Pearl · {item:11082} Greater Astral Essence · {item:11083} Soul Dust · {item:11128} Golden Rod · {item:11135} Greater Mystic Essence · {item:11137} Vision Dust · {item:11144} Truesilver Rod · {spell:13637} Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility · {item:11145} Runed Truesilver Rod · {spell:13746} Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11072} ({zone:1429}); Horde {npc:11074} ({zone:1442}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:13628} (from 150). 150-225 takes 1 {item:5500}, 1 {item:7971}, 1 {item:11082}, 71 {item:11083}, 1 {item:11128}, 1 {item:11135}, 21 {item:11137} and 1 {item:11144} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {spell:13637} (from 160), {item:11145} (from 200) and {spell:13746} (from 205), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "高階可將技能上限從150提高到225，費用50銀幣（經典舊世價格；資料中沒有無限價格）；需要{skill:333}125和角色20級，因此技能125後任何一次經過時都可學習。只有少數訓練師能教：聯盟{npc:11072}（{zone:1429}）；部落{npc:11074}（{zone:1442}）。箭頭指向本陣營最近的一位。現在學習：{spell:13628}（需要技能150）。150-225需收集或購買1個{item:5500}、1個{item:7971}、1個{item:11082}、71個{item:11083}、1個{item:11128}、1個{item:11135}、21個{item:11137}和1個{item:11144}。帶齊材料再來（按上方步驟準備，其餘從拍賣行購買）：這些訓練師還教授{spell:13637}（需要160）、{item:11145}（需要200）及{spell:13746}（需要205），而製作無需工作臺，所以可就在這裡製作，技能達標就學習對應配方。這樣只需跑1趟，不用3趟。",

	-- Step 28: Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina to 160
	-- {spell:13501} Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina
	["{spell:13501} to 160"] = "{spell:13501} 到160",
	-- {spell:13501} Enchant Bracer - Lesser Stamina · {item:11083} Soul Dust · {item:11130} Runed Golden Rod
	["{spell:13501} is orange at 150 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 11 crafts to 160. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:11130} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. If you got here without learning {spell:13501}, learn it now: an earlier step teaches it."] = "{spell:13501}在150時為橙色（黃色155，綠色175，灰色195）：大約製作11次到160。每次需要1個{item:11083}。每次一個{item:11083}（21-30級綠色物品）。現在就做{item:11130}，趁它還能加點：後面的配方需要它在你的背包裡，所以留著。給背包裡該部位的任何物品附魔，灰色的也行。如果你到這裡還沒學會{spell:13501}，現在就學：之前的步驟會教。",

	-- Step 29: Enchanting recipes at 160
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting
	["{skill:333} recipes at 160"] = "{skill:333}160點的配方",
	-- {spell:13637} Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:13637} (from 160)."] = "仍在高級訓練師那裡：{spell:13637}（160點起）。",

	-- Step 30: Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility to 205
	-- {spell:13637} Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility
	["{spell:13637} to 205"] = "{spell:13637}練到205",
	-- {spell:13637} Enchant Boots - Lesser Agility · {item:11083} Soul Dust
	["{spell:13637} is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 59 crafts to 205. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. {item:11083} again. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13637}在160時為橙色（180黃、200綠、220灰）：大約59次製作可到205。每次需要1個{item:11083}。又是{item:11083}。給包中該部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",

	-- Step 31: Enchanting recipes at 205
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting
	["{skill:333} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:333}205點的配方",
	-- {spell:13702} Runed Truesilver Rod · {spell:13746} Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:13702} (from 200) and {spell:13746} (from 205)."] = "仍在高階訓練師處：{spell:13702}（200起）和{spell:13746}（205起）。",

	-- Step 32: Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense to 225
	-- {spell:13746} Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense
	["{spell:13746} to 225"] = "{spell:13746}練到225",
	-- {spell:13746} Enchant Cloak - Greater Defense · {item:11137} Vision Dust · {item:11145} Runed Truesilver Rod · {item:7971} Black Pearl · {skill:333} Enchanting
	["{spell:13746} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 245, grey 265): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. One {item:11137} a craft (level 31-40 greens). Make the {item:11145} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:7971} (1 for 150-225): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13746}在技能205時為橙色（225變黃，245變綠，265變灰）：約製作20次可到225，每次漲一點。每次需要1個{item:11137}。也就是每次1個{item:11137}（來自31-40級綠色物品）。先製作{item:11145}：使用此配方時需將它保留在揹包中。{item:7971}（150-225需1個）：{item:7971}掉落稀有（沒有怪物的掉率達到五十分之一），可從拍賣行購買，或保留途中找到的。揹包中對應裝備欄位的任意物品均可用於附魔，灰色物品也行。{skill:333}225是傳承系統的一個里程碑。",

	-- Step 33: Artisan Enchanting
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting
	["Artisan {skill:333}"] = "專家級{skill:333}",
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting · {npc:11073} Annora · {area:1517} Uldaman · {zone:1418} Badlands · {spell:13815} Enchant Gloves - Agility · {item:8831} Purple Lotus · {item:11137} Vision Dust · {item:11176} Dream Dust
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:333} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. {npc:11073} teaches Artisan {skill:333} inside the {area:1517} dungeon ({zone:1418}); bring a group. Learn now: {spell:13815} (from 210). 225-300 takes about 2g 20s of recipes and 1g 70s of vendor goods, plus 34 {item:8831}, 39 {item:11137} and 208 {item:11176} to gather or buy."] = "大師級把上限從225提高到300，收費5金（經典舊世的價格；Forever的價格不在資料中）；它需要{skill:333} 200和角色35級，所以從200起任何一次造訪都能學。{npc:11073}在{area:1517}地城（{zone:1418}）內教授大師級{skill:333}；要帶隊伍。現在學：{spell:13815}（210起）。225-300大約花2金20銀的配方錢和1金70銀的商人貨物，外加34個{item:8831}、39個{item:11137}和208個{item:11176}，需自行採集或購買。",

	-- Step 34: Enchanting 225-300: vendor goods
	-- {skill:333} Enchanting
	["{skill:333} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:333} 225-300：商人貨物",
	-- {item:8925} Crystal Vial · {zone:1453} Stormwind City · {npc:1286} Edna Mullby · {npc:1325} Jasper Fel · {zone:1454} Orgrimmar · {npc:3367} Felika · {npc:3348} Kor'geld · {npc:3334} Rekkul
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 34 {item:8925} (1g 70s); about 1g 70s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, Eldraeith and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次買齊這一段所需的全部：34個{item:8925}（1金70銀）；總共約1金70銀。箭頭會指向本陣營最近的賣家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、Eldraeith和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",

	-- Step 35: Formula: Lesser Mana Oil
	-- {item:20754} Formula: Lesser Mana Oil · {item:20747} Lesser Mana Oil · {skill:333} Enchanting · {npc:15419} Kania · {zone:1451} Silithus
	["{item:20754} teaches {item:20747} ({skill:333} 250) for 1g. Sold by {npc:15419} ({zone:1451})."] = "{item:20754}教{item:20747}（{skill:333} 250），售價1金。出售者{npc:15419}（{zone:1451}）。",

	-- Step 36: Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina
	-- {item:16217} Formula: Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina · {spell:20017} Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina · {skill:333} Enchanting · {npc:4229} Mythrin'dir · {zone:1457} Darnassus · {npc:4561} Daniel Bartlett · {zone:1458} Undercity
	["{item:16217} teaches {spell:20017} ({skill:333} 265) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:4229} ({zone:1457}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:4561} ({zone:1458}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:16217}教{spell:20017}（{skill:333} 265），售價1金20銀。出售者：聯盟{npc:4229}（{zone:1457}），限量；部落{npc:4561}（{zone:1458}），限量。賣家每次只備一兩個，售出後過段時間補貨；它拾取即繫結，所以拍賣行永遠沒有。",

